      "role": "user",
      "content": "the last bit was cut off, could u finish that last sentence about it being worth? \n\nalso u mentioned the \"trio\" and \"triad\"—can u go a bit deeper into how the mTORC1 complex actually \"senses\" the leucine specifically? like is there a specific sensor protein involved that detects the leucine presence before the phosphorylation starts? would love the technical details on that sensor mechanism.",
      "source": "evaluator"
